1
00:00:00,416 --> 00:00:04,850
The long-press menu. Hold the bar
for the actions you use most.

2
00:00:06,062 --> 00:00:10,272
Hold the tab. Keep your finger
on the Dock until the ring closes.

3
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:13,916
The menu opens beside it,
and stays when you let go.

4
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:18,488
Tap an action. Each tile runs
its action and the menu closes.

5
00:00:18,528 --> 00:00:20,826
Here, the flashlight comes on.

6
00:00:21,163 --> 00:00:23,048
Hold and drag to move it.

7
00:00:23,088 --> 00:00:25,498
Hold, then move instead of letting go:

8
00:00:25,538 --> 00:00:29,003
the menu steps aside and
the bar follows your finger.

9
00:00:29,369 --> 00:00:30,854
Open its settings.

10
00:00:30,894 --> 00:00:35,604
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Long-press menu.

11
00:00:35,644 --> 00:00:38,132
The preview shows the menu as it is.

12
00:00:38,466 --> 00:00:40,026
Choose the actions.

13
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:44,811
Open Items: remove what you never use,
and add what you want from Available.

14
00:00:44,851 --> 00:00:48,034
Here, Screenshot in place of Stop service.

15
00:00:48,819 --> 00:00:53,049
Pick a panel style.
Under Colours, choose how it is drawn.

16
00:00:53,089 --> 00:00:55,149
Glass blurs what is behind it;

17
00:00:55,189 --> 00:00:58,236
the Deck and the Quick
slider use the same style.

18
00:00:58,570 --> 00:01:03,380
Choose how it opens. Under Animation,
pick an opening animation.

19
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:06,236
The preview plays it
each time you pick one.

20
00:01:06,552 --> 00:01:11,359
Hold the tab again. Your actions,
in the style and animation you picked.

21
00:01:13,852 --> 00:01:16,735
Up next: Choose what each gesture does.
